span.p:
Compact source-only verifier and canonical ledger
Closed keyed decisions and source-wide completeness;
unused bank storage drops only after source validation

One candidate authoring pass
Lossless compact accepted inventory and custody hashes;
full accepted receipt remains compiler-owned

Bounded asynchronous timing
300-second shared gate and candidate model window;
315-second proposal cap includes 15-second completion reserve;
fixed 660-second whole deadline is non-additive, diagnostic and unqualified

Explicit terminal CONFIRM
Verify hash and write sealed bytes;
no model, parser, generation, or repair

Detached independent semantic and UX evaluator
Reads frozen immutable outputs only;
never admits, mutates or denies a consumer transaction
